silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "ClosureConcreteAnchorExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_sections_06_closure_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'ClosureConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, TartuClinicCompleteSystem: the complete Tartu Animal Clinic record and publication system that simultaneously enforces the five spine theorems (monad algebra, twelve-leg cocone, four-gate publish law, multi-view rendering contract, sous observation boundary); also, MonadAlgebraContract: the Tartu Clinic's monad algebra structure (ingest unit, publish multiplication, bind associativity) that makes the EncyclopediaEntry type a free-monad algebra; also, TwelveLegMittensSystem: the Tartu Clinic's twelve-typed-observation system for Mittens (VetRecord_77, MicrochipID_44, BodyMassQuality, WeightMeas_3450g, Value_3450, Unit_grams, PetRole, SleepProcess_7h, SHACLPassReport_77, AuditTrail_77, DomesticCat, FelisCatusTSN183798)." .
